<title>USA: Brookstone Inc Q4 same-store sales rose.</title>
<headline>Brookstone Inc Q4 same-store sales rose.</headline>
<dateline>NASHUA, N.H. 1997-02-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Percent change</p>
<p>		    1997	 1996	     Total     Same-Store</p>
<p>Quarter	   $112.3     $105.1     + 6.9     + 3.2</p>
<p>Year-to-date    $218.0     $196.3    + 11.1     + 5.6</p>
<p>NOTE: Figures in millions except percentage.</p>
<p>Quarter ended Feb 1, 1997.</p>
<p>Results for fiscal 1996 included 53 weeks.  Restating results to exclude the last week in fiscal 1996, sales increased to 9.2 percent and 12.3 percent for the fourth quarter and fiscal year of 1997.</p>
</text>
